From df3511c3b6d1ba01b7dce07951393bbed17964fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:48:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] docs(agents): decisions go to a per-PR file in
 docs/decisions, gathered into RECOMMENDED.md at the cut

Every issue branch appending to the end of RECOMMENDED.md made each merge
re-conflict every other open PR. One file per PR (docs/decisions/<issue>-
<slug>.md) never collides; scripts/collect-decisions.ps1/.sh appends them
in issue order under a vX.Y.Z heading at release step 2 and removes them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
